<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>News & Events</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            margin: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #333;
        }

        .event {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background-color: #fefefe;
        }

            .event h2 {
                margin: 0;
                color: #007BFF;
            }

            .event p {
                margin: 5px 0;
                color: #555;
            }

        .event-date {
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #999;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>News & Events</h1>
        <div class="event">
            <h2>EduConnection Launch Event</h2>
            <p class="event-date">Date: April 15, 2025</p>
            <p>Join us for the official launch of EduConnection, a platform revolutionizing education. Participate in discussions, explore features, and meet the team!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="event">
            <h2>Webinar: Modern Learning Trends</h2>
            <p class="event-date">Date: May 1, 2025</p>
            <p>Attend our expert-led webinar to discover the latest trends and best practices in education technology.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="event">
            <h2>New Course Releases</h2>
            <p class="event-date">Date: May 10, 2025</p>
            <p>We’re excited to announce the release of new courses focusing on AI, machine learning, and data analysis.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
